sgp 2

given
  point A
  p1 = parabola(A)
    a1: a(p1) = 1

construct
  B = focus(p1)
  k1 = circle(B)
    r1: r(k1) = 3
  C = meet(k1, p1)

find
  d1: dx(A, C)
  d2: dy(A, C)

where
  A (0.5, 0.4905242917512697)
  p1 a 1 angle 0° [fixed angle]
  B (1.5, 0.4905242917512697)
  k1 r 3
  C (2.5, 3.31895141649746)
  a1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  r1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d2 label (0.3, 0.3)
